      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떤 녀석이 정원 한복판에\n이렇게 큰 구덩이를 만들어 놓은 거야...!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A40020B140C11DC7740020C815C6D00020D55CBCF5D310C5D0000AC774B807AC8C0020D0700020AD6CB369C774B97C0020B9CCB4E4C5B40020B193C7400020AC70C57C002E002E002E0021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너, MZ단이지!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n사무소 앞이 이 지경인 걸\n카라스바 님이 알았다간 크게 혼날 거라고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108002C0020004D005AB2E8C774C9C0002100100001BE01000AC0ACBB34C18C0020C55EC7740020C7740020C9C0ACBDC7780020AC78000ACE74B77CC2A4BC140020B2D8C7740020C54CC558B2E4AC040020D06CAC8C0020D63CB0A00020AC70B77CACE00021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "혼나고 싶지 않다면\n네가 가서 범인을 찾아 와!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D63CB098ACE00020C2F6C9C00020C54AB2E4BA74000AB124AC000020AC00C11C0020BC94C778C7440020CC3EC5440020C6400021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "범인이라면 분명히\n다른 곳에도 구덩이를 파 놨을 거야!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그러니 빨리 가서 범인을 찾아 오라고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC94C778C774B77CBA740020BD84BA85D788000AB2E4B9780020ACF3C5D0B3C40020AD6CB369C774B97C0020D30C0020B1A8C7440020AC70C57C002100100001BE00000AADF8B7ECB2C80020BE68B9AC0020AC00C11C0020BC94C778C7440020CC3EC5440020C624B77CACE00021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "범인이라면 분명히\n다른 곳에도 구덩이를 파 놨을 거야!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그러니 빨리 가서 범인을 찾아 오라고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC94C778C774B77CBA740020BD84BA85D788000AB2E4B9780020ACF3C5D0B3C40020AD6CB369C774B97C0020D30C0020B1A8C7440020AC70C57C002100100001BE00000AADF8B7ECB2C80020BE68B9AC0020AC00C11C0020BC94C778C7440020CC3EC5440020C624B77CACE00021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
