      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "구덩이를 판 범인은\n이 안에 숨어 있는 것 같다...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n구덩이를 자세히 조사해 보겠습니까?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD6CB369C774B97C0020D3100020BC94C778C740000AC7740020C548C5D00020C228C5B40020C788B2940020AC830020AC19B2E4002E002E002E00100001BE00000AAD6CB369C774B97C0020C790C138D7880020C870C0ACD5740020BCF4ACA0C2B5B2C8AE4C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "조사한다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C870C0ACD55CB2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그만둔다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9CCB454B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "더류!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B354B95800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "구덩이는 다른 곳으로 이어져 있는 것 같다.\n구덩이들을 따라가서 범인을 찾아내자!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD6CB369C774B2940020B2E4B9780020ACF3C73CB85C0020C774C5B4C8380020C788B2940020AC830020AC19B2E4002E000AAD6CB369C774B4E4C7440020B530B77CAC00C11C0020BC94C778C7440020CC3EC544B0B4C79000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
