      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "더류...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B354B958002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이봐, MZ단!\n범인은 찾았겠지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BD10002C0020004D005AB2E80021000ABC94C778C7400020CC3EC558ACA0C9C0003F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬이었어요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC774C5C8C5B4C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "두더류였어요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B450B354B958C600C5B4C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬이라고 해도\n정원을 어지럽힌 녀석을 용서할 순 없지!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n사무소로 데려가겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC774B77CACE00020D574B3C4000AC815C6D0C7440020C5B4C9C0B7FDD78C0020B140C11DC7440020C6A9C11CD5600020C21C0020C5C6C9C0002100100001BE00000AC0ACBB34C18CB85C0020B370B824AC00ACA0C5B40021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "MZ단 너도 따라와!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D005AB2E80020B108B3C40020B530B77CC6400021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "더류...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B354B958002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
