      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사람이든 포켓몬이든\n장난을 쳤으면 그만한 성의를 보여 줘야지!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n자, 정원을 원상 복구시켜 놓으라고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACB78CC774B4E00020D3ECCF13BAACC774B4E0000AC7A5B09CC7440020CCE4C73CBA740020ADF8B9CCD55C0020C131C758B97C0020BCF4C5EC0020C918C57CC9C0002100100001BE01000AC790002C0020C815C6D0C7440020C6D0C0C10020BCF5AD6CC2DCCF1C0020B193C73CB77CACE00021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "더류!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B354B95800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오오, 제법인데!\n예전보다 훨씬 더 깔끔해졌잖아!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624C624002C0020C81CBC95C778B3700021000AC608C804BCF4B2E40020D6E8C52C0020B3540020AE54B054D574C84CC796C5440021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "더류!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B354B95800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "짜식, 마음에 드는데!\n내 부하로 녹청파에 끼워 주겠어.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그럼 더는 장난도 안 칠 테니까!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9DCC2DD002C0020B9C8C74CC5D00020B4DCB294B3700021000AB0B40020BD80D558B85C0020B179CCADD30CC5D00020B07CC6CC0020C8FCACA0C5B4002E00100001BE00000AADF8B7FC0020B354B2940020C7A5B09CB3C40020C5480020CE600020D14CB2C8AE4C0021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이왕 녹청파에 들어오는 거\n강철타입이나 독타입 기술을<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n사용할 수 있어야 폼이 좀 살 텐데 말이지...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C6550020B179CCADD30CC5D00020B4E4C5B4C624B2940020AC70000AAC15CCA0D0C0C785C774B0980020B3C5D0C0C7850020AE30C220C74400100001BE00000AC0ACC6A9D5600020C2180020C788C5B4C57C0020D3FCC7740020C8800020C0B40020D150B3700020B9D0C774C9C0002E002E002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아!\n독찌르기 기술머신이 있나 찾아 볼게.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n무슨 일이 있어도 가르칠 테니 각오하라고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC5440021000AB3C5CC0CB974AE300020AE30C220BA38C2E0C7740020C788B0980020CC3EC5440020BCFCAC8C002E00100001BE00000ABB34C2A80020C77CC7740020C788C5B4B3C40020AC00B974CE600020D14CB2C80020AC01C624D558B77CACE00021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "더류!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B354B95800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이봐! 듣자 하니, 두더류는 진화하면\n강철타입을 얻게 된다더라고!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n우리가 만난 건 운명이었을지도 모르겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BD1000210020B4E3C7900020D558B2C8002C0020B450B354B958B2940020C9C4D654D558BA74000AAC15CCA0D0C0C785C7440020C5BBAC8C0020B41CB2E4B354B77CACE0002100100001BE00000AC6B0B9ACAC000020B9CCB09C0020AC740020C6B4BA85C774C5C8C744C9C0B3C40020BAA8B974ACA0C5B40021001000020114001D0000",
